  "$comment": "Exponential Desktop's factory theme (#EDE-235): the Rerusted palette (rerusted design/tokens.json, #RUST-5/#RUST-15; generated, never transcribed) over the built-in exponential theme, dark, and the eDE spacing scale (Cinnamon / Mint-Y as the reference). eUI's `accent` is the hover surface, so it takes Rerusted's muted; the rust is on ring, strokeActive and chart1: fills and icons, never body text. People and agents edit their copy in ~/.config/exponential-desktop/ui; Version history undoes an edit.",
